<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>Our Vision - KelselPDF</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <script src="/theme.js"></script>
    <style>
        body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 100vh; }
        .content { max-width: 900px; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 2rem; flex: 1; }
        h1, h2, h3 { color: var(--cta-color); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        p, li { color: var(--ntxt-color); margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 1.05rem; }
        ul { margin-left: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        strong { color: var(--sec-color); }
        [data-theme="dark"] strong { color: #a78bfa; }
    </style>
<link rel="icon" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" href="/acct/img/favicon-dark.png">
    <link rel="icon" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" href="/acct/img/favicon-light.png">
</head>
<body class="dashboard-body">
    <nav style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 1rem 5%; background: var(--neu-color); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cbg-color-2);">
        <img src="/acct/img/KelselPDF.png" alt="KelselPDF Logo" id="navLogo" style="height: 40px;">
        <a href="/" class="btn" style="padding: 8px 15px;">Back to Home</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="content glass-panel" style="padding: 3rem;">
        <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Our Vision</h1>
        
        <p>Our vision is to build <strong>Kelsel into a leading digital education and career-development ecosystem for students and young people across Nigeria and Africa</strong>.</p>

        <p>Kelsel will go beyond being an examination-preparation platform. We envision a platform where a student can <strong>prepare for examinations, identify academic weaknesses, access personalized learning support, develop practical digital and professional skills, complete real-world projects, earn certificates, build a portfolio, and prepare for meaningful career opportunities — all within one ecosystem.</strong></p>

        <p>We believe education should not end with passing an examination. <strong>Academic knowledge should be connected to practical skills, creativity, technology, and career readiness.</strong></p>

        <p>Through the combination of <strong>Academic Learning, Skills Development, Artificial Intelligence, Performance Analytics, Projects, Certifications and Career Support</strong>, Kelsel will create a continuous learning journey for users:</p>

        <div style="background: var(--cbg-color-2); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center; font-weight: 600; color: var(--cta-color); font-size: 1.1rem;">
            Learn &rarr; Practice &rarr; Measure &rarr; Improve &rarr; Build Skills &rarr; Create Projects &rarr; Get Certified &rarr; Become Career-Ready
        </div>

        <p>Our long-term goal is to become a trusted platform that supports learners throughout their educational and professional journey — from secondary and tertiary education to graduation, employment, entrepreneurship and continuous upskilling.</p>

        <p>We envision a future where a student does not need to search across multiple platforms for past questions, mock examinations, study materials, AI assistance, professional courses, practical projects and career resources. <strong>Kelsel will bring these experiences together in one accessible, affordable and technology-driven platform.</strong></p>

        <p>As the platform grows, Kelsel will expand beyond individual learners to serve <strong>schools, universities, departments, educational organizations, tutors, employers and other institutions</strong>, creating a broader digital learning infrastructure that can support millions of learners.</p>

        <p>Ultimately, our vision is simple:</p>

        <h3 style="text-align: center; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--cta-color); line-height: 1.6;">
            <strong>To build the platform that helps young people not only pass their exams, but become skilled, confident and prepared for the future.</strong>
        </h3>
    </div>

    <footer style="text-align: center; padding: 3rem 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--cbg-color-2); margin-top: auto;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <a href="/vision" style="color: var(--ntxt-color); text-decoration: none;">Our Vision</a>
            <span style="color: var(--cbg-color-2);">|</span>
            <a href="/privacy" style="color: var(--ntxt-color); text-decoration: none;">Privacy Policy</a>
            <span style="color: var(--cbg-color-2);">|</span>
            <a href="/terms" style="color: var(--ntxt-color); text-decoration: none;">Terms of Service</a>
        </div>
        <p style="color: var(--ntxt-color); font-weight: 500;">&copy; 2026 KelselPDF. Built for student success.</p>
    </footer>
    
    <button class="theme-toggle-btn" onclick="toggleTheme()" title="Toggle Dark/Light Mode">
        <span class="theme-icon"></span>
    </button>
</body>
</html>
